{"seq":5,"slug":"animation","title":"动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/jetpack-compose/animation","wordCount":555,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"动画\">动画</h1><p>Jetpack Compose 提供了丰富的动画 API，从简单的值动画到复杂的手势驱动动画。Compose 的动画系统声明式且可组合，让开发者以最小的代码实现流畅的过渡效果。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Compose 动画系统由四类概念构成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>值动画 <code>animate*AsState</code></strong>：目标值变化时自动过渡，由 <code>AnimationSpec</code>（<code>spring</code> / <code>tween</code> / <code>snap</code> / <code>keyframes</code> / <code>repeatable</code>）控制节奏。</li>\n<li><strong>可见性动画 <code>AnimatedVisibility</code></strong>：控制元素的显示/隐藏，Enter 与 Exit 效果可组合使用。</li>\n<li><strong>状态转换 <code>updateTransition</code></strong>：当多个动画值需要协调同步时，用一个 transition 统一管理。</li>\n<li><strong>无限与手势动画</strong>：<code>rememberInfiniteTransition</code> 用于循环动画（加载指示器），<code>Animatable</code> 配合手势检测实现拖拽、滑动删除等交互式动画，通过 <code>snapTo</code> 跟手、<code>animateTo</code> 收尾。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"animateasstate\">animateAsState</h2><p><code>animate*AsState</code> 是最简单的动画 API，当目标值变化时自动执行动画过渡。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun AnimatedFavoriteButton(isFavorite: Boolean, onClick: () -&gt; Unit) {&#10;    val scale by animateFloatAsState(&#10;        targetValue = if (isFavorite) 1.2f else 1f,&#10;        animationSpec = spring(&#10;            dampingRatio = Spring.DampingRatioMediumBouncy,&#10;            stiffness = Spring.StiffnessLow&#10;        ),&#10;        label = &quot;scale&quot;&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    val tint by animateColorAsState(&#10;        targetValue = if (isFavorite) Color.Red else Color.Gray,&#10;        animationSpec = tween(durationMillis = 300),&#10;        label = &quot;tint&quot;&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    IconButton(onClick = onClick) {&#10;        Icon(&#10;            imageVector = if (isFavorite) Icons.Filled.Favorite else Icons.Outlined.FavoriteBorder,&#10;            contentDescription = &quot;收藏&quot;,&#10;            tint = tint,&#10;            modifier = Modifier.scale(scale)&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AnimatedFavoriteButton(isFavorite: Boolean, onClick: () -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val scale by animateFloatAsState(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        targetValue = if (isFavorite) 1.2f else 1f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animationSpec = spring(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dampingRatio = Spring.DampingRatioMediumBouncy,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            stiffness = Spring.StiffnessLow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        label = \"scale\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val tint by animateColorAsState(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        targetValue = if (isFavorite) Color.Red else Color.Gray,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animationSpec = tween(durationMillis = 300),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        label = \"tint\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    IconButton(onClick = onClick) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Icon(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            imageVector = if (isFavorite) Icons.Filled.Favorite else Icons.Outlined.FavoriteBorder,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            contentDescription = \"收藏\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            tint = tint,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier.scale(scale)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用动画规格对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>AnimationSpec</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>spring()</code></td>\n<td>弹簧物理动画</td>\n<td>自然的反弹效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tween()</code></td>\n<td>时长+缓动曲线</td>\n<td>精确控制时长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>snap()</code></td>\n<td>瞬间完成</td>\n<td>无需动画的状态切换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>keyframes</code></td>\n<td>关键帧动画</td>\n<td>分段控制动画值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>repeatable()</code></td>\n<td>有限次重复</td>\n<td>按钮抖动提示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>infiniteRepeatable()</code></td>\n<td>无限重复</td>\n<td>加载动画</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 为每个 <code>animate*AsState</code> 调用提供有意义的 <code>label</code> 参数，方便在 Android Studio 的 Animation Preview 中调试。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"animatedvisibility\">AnimatedVisibility</h2><p><code>AnimatedVisibility</code> 控制 Composable 的显示和隐藏动画。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun NotificationBanner(&#10;    message: String,&#10;    isVisible: Boolean,&#10;    onDismiss: () -&gt; Unit&#10;) {&#10;    AnimatedVisibility(&#10;        visible = isVisible,&#10;        enter = slideInVertically(initialOffsetY = { -it }) + fadeIn(),&#10;        exit = slideOutVertically(targetOffsetY = { -it }) + fadeOut()&#10;    ) {&#10;        Card(&#10;            modifier = Modifier&#10;                .fillMaxWidth()&#10;                .padding(16.dp),&#10;            colors = CardDefaults.cardColors(&#10;                containerColor = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primaryContainer&#10;            )&#10;        ) {&#10;            Row(&#10;                modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp),&#10;                verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically&#10;            ) {&#10;                Icon(Icons.Default.Info, contentDescription = null)&#10;                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(8.dp))&#10;                Text(text = message, modifier = Modifier.weight(1f))&#10;                IconButton(onClick = onDismiss) {&#10;                    Icon(Icons.Default.Close, contentDescription = &quot;关闭&quot;)&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun NotificationBanner(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    message: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    isVisible: Boolean,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onDismiss: () -> Unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    AnimatedVisibility(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        visible = isVisible,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        enter = slideInVertically(initialOffsetY = { -it }) + fadeIn(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        exit = slideOutVertically(targetOffsetY = { -it }) + fadeOut()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Card(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .fillMaxWidth()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .padding(16.dp),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            colors = CardDefaults.cardColors(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                containerColor = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primaryContainer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Row(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Icon(Icons.Default.Info, contentDescription = null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(8.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Text(text = message, modifier = Modifier.weight(1f))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                IconButton(onClick = onDismiss) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    Icon(Icons.Default.Close, contentDescription = \"关闭\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[AnimatedVisibility] --&gt; B{visible = true?}&#10;    B --&gt;|true| C[执行 Enter 动画]&#10;    B --&gt;|false| D[执行 Exit 动画]&#10;    C --&gt; E[显示内容]&#10;    D --&gt; F[隐藏并移除内容]&#10;&#10;    subgraph Enter 效果&#10;        G[fadeIn]&#10;        H[slideIn]&#10;        I[expandIn]&#10;        J[scaleIn]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Exit 效果&#10;        K[fadeOut]&#10;        L[slideOut]&#10;        M[shrinkOut]&#10;        N[scaleOut]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    classDef effectStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class G,H,I,J,K,L,M,N effectStyle\">graph TD\n    A[AnimatedVisibility] --&gt; B{visible = true?}\n    B --&gt;|true| C[执行 Enter 动画]\n    B --&gt;|false| D[执行 Exit 动画]\n    C --&gt; E[显示内容]\n    D --&gt; F[隐藏并移除内容]\n\n    subgraph Enter 效果\n        G[fadeIn]\n        H[slideIn]\n        I[expandIn]\n        J[scaleIn]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Exit 效果\n        K[fadeOut]\n        L[slideOut]\n        M[shrinkOut]\n        N[scaleOut]\n    end\n\n    classDef effectStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class G,H,I,J,K,L,M,N effectStyle</pre><p>Enter 和 Exit 效果可以使用 <code>+</code> 运算符组合：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>Enter</th>\n<th>Exit</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>淡入淡出</td>\n<td><code>fadeIn()</code></td>\n<td><code>fadeOut()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动</td>\n<td><code>slideInVertically()</code> / <code>slideInHorizontally()</code></td>\n<td><code>slideOutVertically()</code> / <code>slideOutHorizontally()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>展开收缩</td>\n<td><code>expandIn()</code> / <code>expandVertically()</code></td>\n<td><code>shrinkOut()</code> / <code>shrinkVertically()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缩放</td>\n<td><code>scaleIn()</code></td>\n<td><code>scaleOut()</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"transition\">Transition</h2><p><code>updateTransition</code> 管理多个动画值的状态转换，确保它们协调同步。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"enum class CardState { Collapsed, Expanded }&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun ExpandableInfoCard(title: String, content: String) {&#10;    var cardState by remember { mutableStateOf(CardState.Collapsed) }&#10;    val transition = updateTransition(targetState = cardState, label = &quot;card&quot;)&#10;&#10;    val cardElevation by transition.animateDp(&#10;        transitionSpec = { tween(300) },&#10;        label = &quot;elevation&quot;&#10;    ) { state -&gt;&#10;        when (state) {&#10;            CardState.Collapsed -&gt; 2.dp&#10;            CardState.Expanded -&gt; 8.dp&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    val cardRoundedCorner by transition.animateDp(&#10;        transitionSpec = { tween(300) },&#10;        label = &quot;corner&quot;&#10;    ) { state -&gt;&#10;        when (state) {&#10;            CardState.Collapsed -&gt; 12.dp&#10;            CardState.Expanded -&gt; 4.dp&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    val arrowRotation by transition.animateFloat(&#10;        transitionSpec = { tween(300) },&#10;        label = &quot;arrow&quot;&#10;    ) { state -&gt;&#10;        when (state) {&#10;            CardState.Collapsed -&gt; 0f&#10;            CardState.Expanded -&gt; 180f&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    Card(&#10;        modifier = Modifier&#10;            .fillMaxWidth()&#10;            .padding(8.dp)&#10;            .clickable {&#10;                cardState = if (cardState == CardState.Collapsed)&#10;                    CardState.Expanded else CardState.Collapsed&#10;            },&#10;        elevation = CardDefaults.cardElevation(defaultElevation = cardElevation),&#10;        shape = RoundedCornerShape(cardRoundedCorner)&#10;    ) {&#10;        Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {&#10;            Row(verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically) {&#10;                Text(text = title, modifier = Modifier.weight(1f))&#10;                Icon(&#10;                    Icons.Default.KeyboardArrowDown,&#10;                    contentDescription = null,&#10;                    modifier = Modifier.rotate(arrowRotation)&#10;                )&#10;            }&#10;            transition.AnimatedVisibility(visible = { it == CardState.Expanded }) {&#10;                Text(&#10;                    text = content,&#10;                    modifier = Modifier.padding(top = 8.dp),&#10;                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodyMedium&#10;                )&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>enum class CardState { Collapsed, Expanded }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ExpandableInfoCard(title: String, content: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var cardState by remember { mutableStateOf(CardState.Collapsed) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val transition = updateTransition(targetState = cardState, label = \"card\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val cardElevation by transition.animateDp(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        transitionSpec = { tween(300) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        label = \"elevation\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) { state -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        when (state) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            CardState.Collapsed -> 2.dp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            CardState.Expanded -> 8.dp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val cardRoundedCorner by transition.animateDp(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        transitionSpec = { tween(300) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        label = \"corner\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) { state -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        when (state) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            CardState.Collapsed -> 12.dp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            CardState.Expanded -> 4.dp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val arrowRotation by transition.animateFloat(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        transitionSpec = { tween(300) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        label = \"arrow\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) { state -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        when (state) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            CardState.Collapsed -> 0f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            CardState.Expanded -> 180f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Card(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .fillMaxWidth()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .padding(8.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .clickable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                cardState = if (cardState == CardState.Collapsed)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    CardState.Expanded else CardState.Collapsed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        elevation = CardDefaults.cardElevation(defaultElevation = cardElevation),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        shape = RoundedCornerShape(cardRoundedCorner)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Row(verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Text(text = title, modifier = Modifier.weight(1f))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Icon(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    Icons.Default.KeyboardArrowDown,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    contentDescription = null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    modifier = Modifier.rotate(arrowRotation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            transition.AnimatedVisibility(visible = { it == CardState.Expanded }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Text(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    text = content,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    modifier = Modifier.padding(top = 8.dp),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodyMedium</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"infinitetransition\">InfiniteTransition</h2><p><code>rememberInfiniteTransition</code> 创建无限循环的动画，常用于加载指示器和脉冲效果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun PulsingDot(&#10;    color: Color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primary,&#10;    size: Dp = 12.dp&#10;) {&#10;    val infiniteTransition = rememberInfiniteTransition(label = &quot;pulse&quot;)&#10;&#10;    val scale by infiniteTransition.animateFloat(&#10;        initialValue = 0.8f,&#10;        targetValue = 1.2f,&#10;        animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(&#10;            animation = tween(600, easing = FastOutSlowInEasing),&#10;            repeatMode = RepeatMode.Reverse&#10;        ),&#10;        label = &quot;scale&quot;&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    val alpha by infiniteTransition.animateFloat(&#10;        initialValue = 0.4f,&#10;        targetValue = 1f,&#10;        animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(&#10;            animation = tween(600),&#10;            repeatMode = RepeatMode.Reverse&#10;        ),&#10;        label = &quot;alpha&quot;&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    Box(&#10;        modifier = Modifier&#10;            .size(size)&#10;            .scale(scale)&#10;            .alpha(alpha)&#10;            .clip(CircleShape)&#10;            .background(color)&#10;    )&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun LoadingIndicator() {&#10;    Row(&#10;        horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp),&#10;        verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically&#10;    ) {&#10;        repeat(3) { index -&gt;&#10;            val infiniteTransition = rememberInfiniteTransition(label = &quot;dot$index&quot;)&#10;            val offsetY by infiniteTransition.animateFloat(&#10;                initialValue = 0f,&#10;                targetValue = -10f,&#10;                animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(&#10;                    animation = tween(300, delayMillis = index * 100),&#10;                    repeatMode = RepeatMode.Reverse&#10;                ),&#10;                label = &quot;offset&quot;&#10;            )&#10;            Box(&#10;                modifier = Modifier&#10;                    .size(8.dp)&#10;                    .offset(y = offsetY.dp)&#10;                    .clip(CircleShape)&#10;                    .background(MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primary)&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun PulsingDot(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    color: Color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    size: Dp = 12.dp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val infiniteTransition = rememberInfiniteTransition(label = \"pulse\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val scale by infiniteTransition.animateFloat(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        initialValue = 0.8f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        targetValue = 1.2f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            animation = tween(600, easing = FastOutSlowInEasing),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            repeatMode = RepeatMode.Reverse</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        label = \"scale\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val alpha by infiniteTransition.animateFloat(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        initialValue = 0.4f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        targetValue = 1f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            animation = tween(600),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            repeatMode = RepeatMode.Reverse</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        label = \"alpha\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Box(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .size(size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .scale(scale)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .alpha(alpha)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .clip(CircleShape)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .background(color)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun LoadingIndicator() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Row(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        repeat(3) { index -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val infiniteTransition = rememberInfiniteTransition(label = \"dot$index\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val offsetY by infiniteTransition.animateFloat(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                initialValue = 0f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                targetValue = -10f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    animation = tween(300, delayMillis = index * 100),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    repeatMode = RepeatMode.Reverse</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                label = \"offset\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Box(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .size(8.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .offset(y = offsetY.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .clip(CircleShape)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .background(MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primary)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"手势驱动动画\">手势驱动动画</h2><p>使用 <code>Animatable</code> 和手势检测实现交互式动画，如拖拽、滑动删除等。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun SwipeToDismissItem(&#10;    onDismiss: () -&gt; Unit,&#10;    content: @Composable () -&gt; Unit&#10;) {&#10;    val offsetX = remember { Animatable(0f) }&#10;    val scope = rememberCoroutineScope()&#10;&#10;    Box(&#10;        modifier = Modifier&#10;            .fillMaxWidth()&#10;            .pointerInput(Unit) {&#10;                detectHorizontalDragGestures(&#10;                    onDragEnd = {&#10;                        scope.launch {&#10;                            if (kotlin.math.abs(offsetX.value) &gt; size.width / 3) {&#10;                                offsetX.animateTo(&#10;                                    targetValue = if (offsetX.value &gt; 0) size.width.toFloat()&#10;                                        else -size.width.toFloat(),&#10;                                    animationSpec = tween(200)&#10;                                )&#10;                                onDismiss()&#10;                            } else {&#10;                                offsetX.animateTo(0f, spring())&#10;                            }&#10;                        }&#10;                    },&#10;                    onHorizontalDrag = { _, dragAmount -&gt;&#10;                        scope.launch {&#10;                            offsetX.snapTo(offsetX.value + dragAmount)&#10;                        }&#10;                    }&#10;                )&#10;            }&#10;            .offset { IntOffset(offsetX.value.roundToInt(), 0) }&#10;    ) {&#10;        content()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun SwipeToDismissItem(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onDismiss: () -> Unit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    content: @Composable () -> Unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val offsetX = remember { Animatable(0f) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val scope = rememberCoroutineScope()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Box(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .fillMaxWidth()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .pointerInput(Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                detectHorizontalDragGestures(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    onDragEnd = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        scope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            if (kotlin.math.abs(offsetX.value) > size.width / 3) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                offsetX.animateTo(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                    targetValue = if (offsetX.value > 0) size.width.toFloat()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                        else -size.width.toFloat(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                    animationSpec = tween(200)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                onDismiss()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                offsetX.animateTo(0f, spring())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    onHorizontalDrag = { _, dragAmount -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        scope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            offsetX.snapTo(offsetX.value + dragAmount)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .offset { IntOffset(offsetX.value.roundToInt(), 0) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        content()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant 用户&#10;    participant 手势检测&#10;    participant Animatable&#10;    participant UI&#10;&#10;    用户-&gt;&gt;手势检测: 开始拖拽&#10;    手势检测-&gt;&gt;Animatable: snapTo(拖拽位移)&#10;    Animatable-&gt;&gt;UI: 更新偏移量&#10;    用户-&gt;&gt;手势检测: 松手&#10;    手势检测-&gt;&gt;手势检测: 判断位移 &gt; 阈值?&#10;    alt 超过阈值&#10;        手势检测-&gt;&gt;Animatable: animateTo(屏幕外)&#10;        Animatable-&gt;&gt;UI: 滑出动画&#10;        UI-&gt;&gt;UI: onDismiss()&#10;    else 未超过阈值&#10;        手势检测-&gt;&gt;Animatable: animateTo(0, spring)&#10;        Animatable-&gt;&gt;UI: 回弹动画&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant 用户\n    participant 手势检测\n    participant Animatable\n    participant UI\n\n    用户-&gt;&gt;手势检测: 开始拖拽\n    手势检测-&gt;&gt;Animatable: snapTo(拖拽位移)\n    Animatable-&gt;&gt;UI: 更新偏移量\n    用户-&gt;&gt;手势检测: 松手\n    手势检测-&gt;&gt;手势检测: 判断位移 &gt; 阈值?\n    alt 超过阈值\n        手势检测-&gt;&gt;Animatable: animateTo(屏幕外)\n        Animatable-&gt;&gt;UI: 滑出动画\n        UI-&gt;&gt;UI: onDismiss()\n    else 未超过阈值\n        手势检测-&gt;&gt;Animatable: animateTo(0, spring)\n        Animatable-&gt;&gt;UI: 回弹动画\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>Animatable</code> 支持边界限制（<code>updateBounds</code>），可以防止用户将元素拖出可见区域。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>animateAsState</code> 是最简单的动画 API，目标值变化时自动过渡</li>\n<li><code>AnimatedVisibility</code> 控制元素显示/隐藏的过渡动画，支持多种 Enter/Exit 效果组合</li>\n<li><code>updateTransition</code> 协调多个动画值的同步状态转换</li>\n<li><code>InfiniteTransition</code> 用于无限循环动画，适合加载指示器等场景</li>\n<li><code>Animatable</code> 配合手势检测实现交互式动画，支持 <code>snapTo</code> 和 <code>animateTo</code> 两种方式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动画","id":"动画"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"animateAsState","id":"animateasstate"},{"level":2,"text":"AnimatedVisibility","id":"animatedvisibility"},{"level":2,"text":"Transition","id":"transition"},{"level":2,"text":"InfiniteTransition","id":"infinitetransition"},{"level":2,"text":"手势驱动动画","id":"手势驱动动画"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"导航","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/jetpack-compose/navigation-compose"},"next":{"title":"ViewModel 视图模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/architecture-components/viewmodel"}}